  "title": "Burn down Ruff unused-argument ignores",
  "description": "The root Ruff config is suppressing `ARG001`, `ARG002`, and `ARG005` across runtime code and tests. The biggest buckets are `puppeteer/tests/**`, `puppeteer/src/puppeteer/orchestrator.py`, `scripts/analysis/blunder_analysis.py`, and `scripts/analysis/blunder_audit.py`.\n\
\n\
