- `ruff-lint.toml`\n\
- `puppeteer/tests/**`\n\
- `puppeteer/src/puppeteer/orchestrator.py`\n\
- `scripts/analysis/blunder_analysis.py`\n\
- `scripts/analysis/blunder_audit.py`",
